ntent": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le09ob07re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob07re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le09ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le09ob07re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Janet and Peter, thanks for coming in. I was afraid you were not going to make it. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I was able to reschedule my meeting. So, what is this about?  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm here to brief you on our strengths and weaknesses. I started creating a SWOT analysis. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I beg your pardon? I'm not sure I follow you. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: It is a simple tool for auditing an organization and its environment."}, {"time": "23500", "image": "engenn6le09ob07re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm not sure I know what you mean.  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: To put it differently, it helps us analyze our strengths and weaknesses. One of our strengths is that we're the market leader and have been for the last two years ... <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: On the negative side, we are less experienced in the Latin American market. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Perhaps a weakness is that we have little experience in this market. On the other hand, we have strong partnerships as well as a strong marketing team. This gives us a competitive edge."}, {"time": "52500", "image": "engenn6le09ob07re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I agree. Our other main weakness is the lack of information on the Latin American market. But actually this is where Miranda comes in. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: What are you trying to say? Could you clarify that, please? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sorry, I'm not sure I am following you either. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I took a straw poll with our clients and hands down the top reason they gave us for using our services was the strong personal touch we're famous for. What I like about this is, Miranda, you have extensive experience in the fashion industry. And Peter, I want you to be in charge of writing up our SWOT analysis."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Fighting the Competition"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Strengths & Weaknesses"}, {"type": "position", "content": 7}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Grammar - part 1 > Twins After All"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 9}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le09ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Making Positive and Negative Comments"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In the business world, it is important to talk about things that you like and things that you don't like. Here are some ways you can show your co-workers that you like some things but not others:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Positive Signals (Strengths)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Negative signals (Weaknesses)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>On the positive side \u2026 </li><li>What I like about this is \u2026 </li><li>One of the strengths of this is \u2026 </li><li>\u2026 is one of the strengths.</li><li>One of our strengths is \u2026</li></ul></span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>On the negative side \u2026 </li><li>Perhaps a weakness of this is that \u2026 </li><li>This is one of the things I'm not sure of, because \u2026 </li><li>\u2026 is one of the weaknesses.</li><li>Our other main weakness is \u2026</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Moving From Positive To Negative Or From Negative To Positive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>But actually, ...</li><li>On the other hand, \u2026</li><li>Then again, \u2026</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">One of our strengths is </span>that we are leaders and pioneers in this market."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">On the negative side,</span> we are not as experienced as our competitor in the South American market."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">On the other hand,</span> we are a strong and influential marketing team."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Our other main weakness is</span> the lack of bilingual staff in our company."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking for Clarification and Clarifying Meaning"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Sometimes you don't understand what was said or something was not clear to you. It is, therefore, important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressing lacking of understanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Sorry, I am not sure I am following you.</li><li>I beg your pardon, but I don't quite understand.</li><li>I beg your pardon,I'm not sure I follow you.</li><li>I'm not sure I know what you mean.</li><li>I'm not sure I follow you.</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Could you elaborate on that?</li><li>Could you be more specific?</li><li>Could you repeat that, please?</li><li>Could you clarify that, please?</li><li>Do you mean \u2026 ? </li><li>What are you trying to say?</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to reschedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to change the time of a planned event"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was able to reschedule my meeting."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when analyzing a business."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to brief"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to instruct someone on something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm here to brief you on the company's strengths and weaknesses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "strength"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person's good quality"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My strength is my positive attitude. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "weakness"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a quality or feature regarded as a disadvantage"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You must recognize your product's weaknesses. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to audit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to conduct a complete review"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We need to complete an audit of the organization."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to analyze"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to examine in detail"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's analyze our strengths and weaknesses."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "market leader"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the company selling the largest number of a particular type of product"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our company is the market leader in PR."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud07"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "partnership"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the state of working closely with another person or group "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have strong partnerships with many other companies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud08"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a competitive edge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an advantage that a company has over its competitors"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our strong marketing team gives us a competitive edge. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud09"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extensive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "covering or affecting a large area"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You have extensive experience in the fashion industry."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le09ob07aud10"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "What are your strengths and weaknesses when it comes to working in a team? "}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, talk about positive and negative signals when it comes to working in a team."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make sure your partner understands all your points."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my strengths and weaknesses. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about positive and negative signals."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I provide clarification when needed."}]}]}